[b]​Update v1.0.0.1 now available![/b]

- Added a more evident Hit Marker for enemies (enemies will flash red when you hit them);
- Short Sword attack range has been sligtly improved;
- It's now possible to exit "Credits" screen on main menu by pressing "ESC" (it was already possible by pressing "Backspace" or "B"[Gamepad])

Thank you so much for playing and hope you enjoy it even more now!
